<title>JAPAN: Lasertec - 95/96 group results.</title>
<headline>Lasertec - 95/96 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.18		vs	    3.19</p>
<p> Operating    918    million	  vs	  679    million</p>
<p> Current	973    million	  vs	  622    million</p>
<p> Net	    528    million	  vs	  535    million</p>
<p> EPS		   89.70 yen	  vs	   90.81 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Lasertec Corp is a manufacturer of photomask, defect detectors.</p>
